        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Bayern Munich, Juventus, Chelsea, Croatia national team, Bundesliga, UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Super Cup\n- People: Mario Mandžukić, Xherdan Shaqiri, Dante, Claudio Pizarro, Mitchell Weiser, Tom Starke\n- Events: 2012–13 FC Bayern Munich season, 1986–87 FC Bayern Munich season, 2013 UEFA Super Cup\n- Places: German football, Regionalliga Süd\n- Roles: forward\n\nFacts:\n- FC Bayern Munich were promoted from the Regionalliga Süd in 1965.\n- The 2012–13 FC Bayern Munich season was the club's 114th season and its 48th consecutive season in the Bundesliga top flight since promotion in 1965.\n- Before the 2012–13 season, FC Bayern Munich signed Xherdan Shaqiri, Dante, Claudio Pizarro, Mitchell Weiser, Tom Starke, and Mario Mandžukić.\n- A feat from the 1986–87 FC Bayern Munich season set two Bundesliga records that were not repeated until the 2012–13 season.\n- Mario Mandžukić was born on 21 May 1986.\n- Mario Mandžukić is a Croatian professional footballer who plays as a forward for Juventus and the Croatia national team.\n- The 2013 UEFA Super Cup featured Bayern Munich as the winners of the 2012–13 UEFA Champions League and Chelsea as the winners of the 2012–13 UEFA Europa League.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
